 "result": "```python\nimport math\nimport cadquery as cq\n\nL = 60.0\nT = 6.0\ncenter_d = 22.0\nhole_d = 3.2\nbc_r = 50.8 / 2.0\n\npts = [\n    (bc_r * math.cos(math.radians(a)), bc_r * math.sin(math.radians(a)))\n    for a in (45, 135, 225, 315)\n]\n\nplate = (\n    cq.Workplane(\"XY\")\n    .box(L, L, T)\n    .faces(\">Z\").workplane()\n    .hole(center_d)\n    .faces(\">Z\").workplane()\n    .pushPoints(pts)\n    .hole(hole_d)\n)\n\ncq.exporters.export(plate, \"out.step\")\n```",
